    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps to reproduce</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to <a href="https://consumersenergymanagement.ca/savings-calculator/" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">consumersenergymanagement.ca/savings-calculator</a></li>
</ol>


<p> </p>

<p><b>Expected result</b></p>

<p>The panel is located on the left side of the screen under the name “Products.” Below are listed functions that, when clicked, open a new page corresponding to each function. For example:</p>

<ol>
	<li>Products</li>
	<li>Clicking- Cooling System and Products</li>
	<li>Opens the new page - Cooling System and Products.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Actual result</b></p>

<p>When clicking on some elements in the “Products” column, they are not clickable, making it impossible to navigate the site. The following labels do not respond:</p>

<ol>
	<li>Cooling System and Products</li>
	<li>Water Heaters and Tanks</li>
	<li>Heating System and Products</li>
	<li>Energy Efficient Humidifiers</li>
</ol>




<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/11263" alt="Снимок экрана 2025-01-08 140203.png" height="253" width="313" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
            <br/>
