    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps to reproduce</b> </p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to <a href="https://consumersenergymanagement.ca/savings-calculator/" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">consumersenergymanagement.ca/savings-calculator</a></li>
</ol>




<p><b>Expected result</b> </p>

<p>When the site is opened, the “Functionality” panel is in its correct position at the top of the page. The user can use it, if desired, to navigate to other pages of the site.</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b> </p>

<p>The functionality panel is located in the middle of the site, blocking other important features. This makes it impossible to use the page in the middle of the screen.</p>



<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/11262" alt="Снимок экрана 2025-01-08 132123.png" height="204" width="840" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>Reproduced in Microsoft Edge.</p>

<p>Version 131.0.2903.86 (Official Build) (64-bit version)</p>



<p>Error from Microsoft Edge console:</p>

<p>‹div class="menu-header-menu-container"&gt;</p>
