<p>The page opens, and we see the page of the calculator for counting.</p>

<p>Ap the top , there is a search bar for the site that the user  can be open and close.</p>



<p><b>Actual result</b> </p>

<p>When the calculator page is opened, the search bar also appears. The search bar does not respond to the close function. After refreshing the page, the search bar remains open.</p>



<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/11261" alt="Снимок экрана 2025-01-08 125709.png" height="995" width="1400" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>



