    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps to reproduce:</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to : <a href="https://consumersenergymanagement.ca/savings-calculator/#" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Saving Calculator Heating and Cooling Products &amp; Services</a></li>
	<li>(Located in the Step 2 Window)</li>
	<li>Select a  Current Heating System- Heat Pump.</li>
	<li>Select a New Heating System- Dual Fuel-Natural gas.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected result:</b></p>

<p>With this selection, an additional ‘Temperature’ window will open. This field should be located in the window (Efficiency Level of New System)</p>

<p><b>Actual result:</b></p>

<p>This window does not match the design and is not positioned correctly. It causes an error, and the image (Step 2) becomes unavailable for use.</p>



<p>Reproduced in Microsoft Edge.</p>

<p>Version 131.0.2903.86 (Official Build) (64-bit version)</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Error from Microsoft Edge console:</p>

<p>therm30.png:1</p>
