    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps to reproduce:</b> </p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to : <a href="https://consumersenergymanagement.ca/savings-calculator/#" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Saving Calculator Heating and Cooling Products &amp; Services</a></li>
	<li>(Located in the Step 1 Window) Select State -British Columbia</li>
	<li>Click on the City -Select state first .</li>
	<li>Select a city from the list .</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected result:</b> </p>

<p>A list of cities for the selected state will appear.</p>

<p><b>Actual result:</b> </p>

<p>The (Select state first) field is empty. City selection is not possible.</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/11245" alt="image-20241212-230352.png" height="271" width="470" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>Reproduced in Microsoft Edge.</p>

<p>Version 131.0.2903.86 (Official Build) (64-bit version)</p>



<p>Error from Microsoft Edge console: </p>

<p>&lt;option value="#"&gt;Select State First&lt;/option&gt;</p>
